<https://github.com/litlfred/smart-trust-tools/kg/id/STT-GEN-005/derivation/2>
    a stt:Derivation ;
    stt:source <https://github.com/litlfred/smart-trust-tools/kg/id/dir-targets> .

<https://github.com/litlfred/smart-trust-tools/kg/id/STT-GEN-005/derivation/3>
